WEBVTT

00:01:33.180 --> 00:01:35.650
An M40A1 sniper rifle!

00:01:35.650 --> 00:01:37.280
308 caliber!

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:39.020
FRP stock!

00:01:39.020 --> 00:01:42.020
Lever-mount Unert; 10x scope!

00:01:42.020 --> 00:01:44.990
A 120% fully-accurate reproduction!

00:01:44.990 --> 00:01:47.360
225,000 yen...

00:01:48.360 --> 00:01:50.040
If only I had one of these!

00:01:52.160 --> 00:01:55.400
Crap! It's a debt collector!

00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:58.470
Hold on. The deadline's still a ways off...

00:01:58.770 --> 00:02:00.910
Who's bothering me this late at...

00:02:00.910 --> 00:02:02.340
<i>Hello!</i>

00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:04.010
These boobs!

00:02:04.010 --> 00:02:05.670
Asagiri Junko!

00:02:07.910 --> 00:02:10.020
What?!

00:02:10.020 --> 00:02:12.580
<i>You're a kid!</i>

00:02:12.750 --> 00:02:16.850
<i>"Mizuno Kanta"</i>

00:02:13.420 --> 00:02:15.650
<i>His name is Mizuno Kanta.</i>

00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:16.890
<i>A freelance handyman.</i>

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:19.360
What's your problem?!

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:24.630
<i>I just can't believe the great
Sunabouzu is actually a kid!</i>

00:02:24.630 --> 00:02:27.800
Oh, crap! My secret identity!

00:02:27.900 --> 00:02:34.090
<i>"Sunabouzu - Desert Punk"</i>

00:02:28.030 --> 00:02:31.870
<i>People have recently started
referring to him as the Sunabouzu,</i>

00:02:31.870 --> 00:02:34.410
<i>and he is now a rather popular figure.</i>

00:02:34.410 --> 00:02:36.540
So why are you here?!

00:02:36.540 --> 00:02:38.810
<i>Work, I came to hire you.</i>

00:02:38.810 --> 00:02:39.910
Get lost!

00:02:39.910 --> 00:02:43.700
<i>I know you're up to your
head in debt at the moment.</i>

00:02:43.880 --> 00:02:46.060
How do you know that?!

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:52.890
<i>"Debt King"</i>

00:02:46.280 --> 00:02:50.820
<i>He screwed up two jobs and wound
up taking on others' debts.</i>

00:02:50.820 --> 00:02:52.860
<i>Women were involved both times.</i>

00:02:53.430 --> 00:02:55.830
<i>I heard from the guild head.</i>

00:02:55.830 --> 00:02:57.610
That old geezer!

00:02:57.730 --> 00:03:01.370
Forget that; how dare
you use me back then?!

00:03:01.370 --> 00:03:03.290
<i>Quit touching me!</i>

00:03:09.510 --> 00:03:10.890
So supple!

00:03:13.440 --> 00:03:15.290
<i>That'll cost you 10,000 yen.</i>

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:20.340
<i>You lost to me.
So quit sulking, it's pathetic!</i>

00:03:20.920 --> 00:03:22.920
<i>So, how much do you owe?</i>

00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:26.790
1,693,452 yen, but...

00:03:28.760 --> 00:03:31.630
<i>- I'll pay you 6 million.</i>

00:03:28.760 --> 00:03:31.630
- 3 million yen.

00:03:31.890 --> 00:03:33.160
I'll do it.

00:03:33.160 --> 00:03:35.130
Please allow me to do it.

00:03:43.510 --> 00:03:45.290
So supple!

00:03:45.640 --> 00:03:47.880
Six million yen...

00:03:47.880 --> 00:03:51.070
I'll pay off my debt and buy an M40...

00:03:51.180 --> 00:03:55.700
What else should I buy?
Maybe I'll put it in savings?

00:03:56.210 --> 00:03:59.820
Oh! So supple!

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:12.060
<i>That night, Mizuno Kanta had
a very pleasurable dream.</i>

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:13.630
<i>However!</i>

00:04:21.580 --> 00:04:25.800
<i>Hey, Sunabouzu! Nobody ever
mentioned taking on that monster!</i>

00:04:26.350 --> 00:04:31.260
<i>And that chick is your acquaintance!
This's all your fault!</i>

00:04:31.260 --> 00:04:36.360
Oh, get real! You know you
fell for her charms, too!

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:38.330
There it is!

00:04:39.160 --> 00:04:40.700
<i>It's unstoppable!</i>

00:04:40.700 --> 00:04:43.170
<i>They say it streaks through
the desert like lightning</i>

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:47.940
<i>and scorches those who stand in
its way into a boneless crisp!</i>

00:04:47.940 --> 00:04:53.850
<i>The Great Kanto Desert's most heavily
armed and armored bank transport truck!</i>

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:59.120
<i>A killing machine that's returned
from the centuries-old Hell!</i>

00:04:59.380 --> 00:05:00.780
<i>The Fire Dragon Kong...</i>

00:05:04.260 --> 00:05:08.590
<i>Do you actually think you can
escape, Asagiri Junko-san?</i>

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:12.430
<i>Those are some rather dependable
bodyguards you've hired...</i>

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:17.940
<i>Misjudge these four and
you'll be in a world of hurt!</i>

00:05:17.940 --> 00:05:21.010
<i>Nuh uh! Nuh uh! No hurt at all!</i>

00:05:21.010 --> 00:05:26.710
<i>These four are men of the desert
with great hidden potential!</i>

00:05:26.710 --> 00:05:28.900
<i>No we aren't!</i>

00:05:29.150 --> 00:05:30.840
<i>Then show me</i>

00:05:31.520 --> 00:05:33.250
<i>No! Don't!</i>

00:05:37.990 --> 00:05:40.490
<i>- That got him?!
- You think?</i>

00:05:40.490 --> 00:05:43.090
<i>Ain't no withstanding a 40-millimeter...</i>

00:05:43.090 --> 00:05:44.430
<i>What're you doing?!</i>

00:05:44.430 --> 00:05:45.950
<i>Start running already!</i>

00:05:55.310 --> 00:05:57.480
<i>It's no use running.</i>

00:05:57.480 --> 00:06:00.600
<i>Do you intend on never
handing the key over?</i>

00:06:01.010 --> 00:06:03.520
<i>That's not why I'm running
all over the place!</i>

00:06:03.520 --> 00:06:04.120
Key?!

00:06:04.100 --> 00:06:07.000
<i>"Handyman"</i>

00:06:04.120 --> 00:06:06.320
Hey, Haruo!

00:06:06.320 --> 00:06:07.280
<i>What?!</i>

00:06:08.320 --> 00:06:09.120
<i>Haruo!</i>

00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:10.280
<i>Haruo!</i>

00:06:10.820 --> 00:06:11.790
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:06:11.790 --> 00:06:13.520
<i>Damn you, Sunabouzu!</i>

00:06:15.190 --> 00:06:17.060
What the heck did you do?!

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:21.530
You must've screwed over someone
big to get the Kong after you!

00:06:21.530 --> 00:06:26.300
Listen! I'm allowed to cancel
contracts for crime-related jobs!

00:06:26.300 --> 00:06:31.500
<i>It's true that he's super rich,
but this is entirely a private dispute.</i>

00:06:32.970 --> 00:06:37.910
Dammit! I'd turn you down
if I weren't in debt!

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:41.110
Damn you for showing off
your giant boobies!

00:06:41.110 --> 00:06:42.780
<i>Eh? What?</i>

00:06:42.780 --> 00:06:45.750
<i>I don't like desert suits or helmets
so I figured I'd go without</i>

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:48.760
<i>during the morning...</i>

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:52.490
Liar! You know you showed them on purpose!

00:06:52.490 --> 00:06:54.020
<i>I did not!</i>

00:06:58.530 --> 00:07:01.840
<i>Damn you! How dare you use us as a decoy!</i>

00:07:01.840 --> 00:07:02.840
Don't be dumb!

00:07:02.840 --> 00:07:07.210
If that were the case, I'd have been
long gone instead of here flirting!

00:07:07.910 --> 00:07:10.280
He won't kill us!

00:07:10.280 --> 00:07:11.480
<i>What?!</i>

00:07:11.480 --> 00:07:12.610
<i>We're done for!</i>

00:07:12.610 --> 00:07:14.680
<i>We're so dead!</i>

00:07:14.680 --> 00:07:18.090
<i>Not good! It's just a matter of time!</i>

00:07:18.090 --> 00:07:19.150
No choice!

00:07:19.070 --> 00:07:19.740
<i>"Light" "Smoke"</i>

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:22.720
Shut your eyes!

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:25.690
<i>What the... - ?!</i>

00:07:25.690 --> 00:07:28.960
<i>An ultra-hot flash bomb
and iron filing smoke bomb!</i>

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:31.370
<i>It screwed up all our scanners!</i>

00:07:31.370 --> 00:07:33.240
<i>Huh? It's just a smoke screen!</i>

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:35.830
<i>Stop! What are you...</i>

00:07:36.800 --> 00:07:37.940
<i>Where are they?!</i>

00:07:37.940 --> 00:07:38.870
<i>They're gone!</i>

00:07:40.510 --> 00:07:41.540
<i>There they are!</i>

00:07:41.540 --> 00:07:45.080
<i>No! That dried-up well is full of tunnels!</i>

00:07:45.080 --> 00:07:46.010
<i>Don't let 'em down it!</i>

00:07:47.310 --> 00:07:48.410
<i>They went down it-</i>

00:07:48.750 --> 00:07:49.680
<i>Dimwits!</i>

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:53.050
<i>What the hell? A balloon?</i>

00:07:53.050 --> 00:07:55.190
<i>There's nobody in the well!</i>

00:07:55.190 --> 00:07:59.390
<i>Come to think of it, that notorious
Sunabouzu was with them...</i>

00:07:59.390 --> 00:08:00.790
<i>We've been fooled.</i>

00:08:01.060 --> 00:08:02.730
<i>After them! To the east!</i>

00:08:02.730 --> 00:08:03.350
<i>Yes, sir!</i>

00:08:17.410 --> 00:08:19.250
They finally left...

00:08:19.250 --> 00:08:23.320
<i>You freaked me out by
suddenly dumping sand on me!</i>

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:25.420
I couldn't have completely blinded the Kong

00:08:25.420 --> 00:08:28.360
with just one person's
supply of smoke bombs...

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:33.820
<i>What a lame plan! What if the
Kong had kept sitting there?!</i>

00:08:34.160 --> 00:08:35.150
Dunno.

00:08:37.060 --> 00:08:40.370
<i>Hey, why are we taking a long way?!</i>

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:44.270
Hovercrafts don't handle
cluttered terrain well.

00:08:45.110 --> 00:08:48.380
<i>Why didn't you tell us up front
we'd be dealing with the Kong?!</i>

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:50.940
<i>Because you wouldn't have accepted the job!</i>

00:08:50.940 --> 00:08:52.310
<i>Duh!</i>

00:08:52.310 --> 00:08:56.280
Geez... Today's the horrible
sequel to this morning!

00:08:56.280 --> 00:08:57.750
Six million!

00:08:59.820 --> 00:09:02.560
You're the Kawaguchi
Machine Gun Brothers!

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:04.320
<i>And you're the Sunabouzu!</i>

00:09:04.320 --> 00:09:06.390
<i>What're you doing here?!</i>

00:09:06.390 --> 00:09:09.960
<i>Yeah! Who needs your nasty ol'
face first thing in the morning?!</i>

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:11.190
That's my line!

00:09:12.600 --> 00:09:14.740
<i>Sorry! Been waiting long?</i>

00:09:14.740 --> 00:09:18.210
<i>That's all right! Just got here...</i>

00:09:18.210 --> 00:09:21.270
Huh?! Don't tell me she hired you, too?

00:09:21.270 --> 00:09:23.210
<i>Eh?! You too?!</i>

00:09:23.210 --> 00:09:25.150
<i>We're all friends now!</i>

00:09:25.150 --> 00:09:28.050
<i>Now let's work together and do our best!</i>

00:09:32.020 --> 00:09:34.080
<i>Eh?!</i>

00:09:34.860 --> 00:09:37.020
<i>Damn, this sucks...</i>

00:09:38.460 --> 00:09:41.160
<i>I had no idea you were
childhood friends!</i>

00:09:41.160 --> 00:09:44.560
<i>B-but, Akio-niichan!</i>

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:45.570
<i>Yeah...</i>

00:09:45.570 --> 00:09:47.730
<i>S-so big...</i>

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:51.670
<i>If only ol' Natsuko could take after her...</i>

00:09:52.610 --> 00:09:58.550
<i>Say, what'd you mean when
you said he won't kill us?</i>

00:09:58.550 --> 00:10:02.040
Isn't it obvious? They said it themselves.

00:10:02.150 --> 00:10:03.950
OK, Junko-san.

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:09.250
How about you tell us about that
key in your intense cleavage there?

00:10:10.120 --> 00:10:14.960
Those guys want it bad.
So they can't kill us.

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:18.400
The key'd be toast if they screwed up.

00:10:18.400 --> 00:10:21.400
So out with the details!

00:10:21.400 --> 00:10:24.560
What is that key?
Why is the Kong after you?

00:10:25.410 --> 00:10:26.840
<i>Alright.</i>

00:10:26.840 --> 00:10:28.580
<i>Remember this?</i>

00:10:28.580 --> 00:10:31.480
<i>It's the treasure I swiped
from you in Episode 1.</i>

00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:36.450
<i>It actually belongs to the wife
of Okawa Taiko, of Okawa Products-</i>

00:10:36.450 --> 00:10:39.890
<i>As you know, my armored
truck was attacked recently.</i>

00:10:39.890 --> 00:10:45.360
<i>Among its contents was a key
to a jewelry box your mom treasured.</i>

00:10:45.360 --> 00:10:49.280
<i>The one who brings it back
to me will be my heir.</i>

00:10:49.630 --> 00:10:50.500
<i>There you have it.</i>

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:55.640
<i>And our client in Episode 1 was
his first son, Okawa Koichi.</i>

00:10:55.640 --> 00:10:59.040
<i>Next episode, it was his
second son, Okawa Koji.</i>

00:10:59.040 --> 00:11:02.610
<i>I was suddenly like, "Whoa,
I can make some big money!"</i>

00:11:02.610 --> 00:11:06.380
<i>So I secretly contacted the first
son and negotiated with the second.</i>

00:11:06.380 --> 00:11:09.950
<i>I really worked my butt off
during Episode 2!</i>

00:11:09.950 --> 00:11:12.390
A bidding war, basically?

00:11:12.390 --> 00:11:15.320
<i>Yep! But I guess I went a little too far,</i>

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:18.890
<i>because the second son got
pissed and got into the Kong...</i>

00:11:18.890 --> 00:11:22.460
<i>Anyways, if we can just get out
of the second son's territory</i>

00:11:22.460 --> 00:11:26.190
<i>and get to the first son's
East Oasis, we'll have won!</i>

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:31.280
<i>So, you alright with that?</i>

00:11:31.850 --> 00:11:33.210
<i>Uhh...</i>

00:11:33.210 --> 00:11:37.210
I suppose we'll manage. I do have a plan...

00:11:37.410 --> 00:11:41.650
<i>Really?! Awesome! So how do
we take care of the Kong?!</i>

00:11:41.850 --> 00:11:44.850
Are you crazy! We can't kill that thing!

00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:46.790
We're just gonna run like hell!

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:48.660
<i>Oh, geez.</i>

00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:51.860
<i>Way to go, Sunabouzu, as petty as always.</i>

00:11:51.860 --> 00:11:55.730
Only the stupidest and dumbest
moron of the Great Kanto Desert

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:58.060
would ever think of crushing that thing!

00:12:28.700 --> 00:12:30.160
<i>Sunabouzu!</i>

00:12:37.570 --> 00:12:41.410
<i>Ghost of the Desert, my butt!
What a let-down!</i>

00:12:41.410 --> 00:12:47.250
<i>He's always been that way. All he
ever did was disappoint people...</i>

00:12:47.250 --> 00:12:49.780
<i>Not to mention being rude and filthy!</i>

00:12:49.780 --> 00:12:53.220
<i>He was puny and stupid
and idiotic and pathetic...</i>

00:12:54.220 --> 00:12:56.960
<i>Your badmouthing-dead-people convention...</i>

00:12:56.960 --> 00:12:59.360
<i>...is now over.</i>

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:06.040
<i>Unkempt desert scum.
How dare you resist me.</i>

00:13:06.600 --> 00:13:08.500
<i>Don't expect to die peacefully.</i>

00:13:09.040 --> 00:13:11.130
<i>I'll start by tearing your clothes off.</i>

00:13:12.110 --> 00:13:14.040
<i>Retrieve the key!</i>

00:13:14.040 --> 00:13:15.260
<i>With pleasure!</i>

00:13:18.410 --> 00:13:20.240
<i>Boobie Lady!</i>

00:13:29.060 --> 00:13:30.680
<i>Hiro-kun fell off the cliff!</i>

00:13:37.660 --> 00:13:40.060
You're dead!

00:13:40.060 --> 00:13:42.040
You are so dead!

00:13:45.870 --> 00:13:47.640
I hurt all over...

00:13:47.640 --> 00:13:49.000
<i>Oh, you're alive?!</i>

00:13:49.480 --> 00:13:51.780
<i>You're as stubborn as always!</i>

00:13:51.780 --> 00:13:54.300
Even I thought I died!

00:13:54.880 --> 00:13:59.020
Thanks to you, my treasures
all got busted up!

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:02.020
My newly-repaired Type Zero Helmet...

00:14:02.020 --> 00:14:05.630
My lifeline in the desert.
my Cherry Blossom Air Cooler...

00:14:05.630 --> 00:14:08.560
My old man's Winchester!

00:14:08.560 --> 00:14:12.460
<i>Freeze! Hands up! How dare
you hurt Hiro-kun!</i>

00:14:13.450 --> 00:14:20.370
You damn rich jerk-off!
You'll pay for this!

00:14:22.730 --> 00:14:25.950
<i>Stop! What're you doing, you idiot?!</i>

00:14:25.950 --> 00:14:27.550
Ow!

00:14:27.550 --> 00:14:29.370
<i>What the heck are they doin'?</i>

00:14:37.380 --> 00:14:40.190
<i>What are you doing, you perv?!</i>

00:14:51.840 --> 00:14:52.960
<i>My key!</i>

00:14:54.410 --> 00:14:58.670
Want this key? Then come catch me!

00:15:04.070 --> 00:15:05.890
<i>It's no use! We can't see him!</i>

00:15:05.890 --> 00:15:07.860
<i>After him! Into the Kong!</i>

00:15:07.860 --> 00:15:09.660
<i>- Ahh!
- What is it?!</i>

00:15:09.660 --> 00:15:12.290
<i>The girl and the three brothers escaped too!</i>

00:15:12.290 --> 00:15:13.050
<i>What?!</i>

00:15:15.300 --> 00:15:19.870
<i>Damn Kanta went completely
mental! This ain't good!</i>

00:15:19.870 --> 00:15:20.950
<i>How's that?!</i>

00:15:20.950 --> 00:15:24.140
<i>There's no tellin' what he'll
do when he's like that!</i>

00:15:24.140 --> 00:15:28.770
<i>He might try to die
in battle to get revenge!</i>

00:15:28.780 --> 00:15:32.350
<i>Listen, Akio, Haruo! Get the key
back, even if you gotta kill him!</i>

00:15:32.350 --> 00:15:33.970
<i>Sounds good to me!</i>

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:45.490
<i>Bastard! I'll teach you!</i>

00:15:47.230 --> 00:15:51.460
<i>You idiot! He has the key!
Retrieve it intact!</i>

00:15:51.460 --> 00:15:54.460
<i>He isn't wearing a mask! I'll use gas!</i>

00:15:58.940 --> 00:15:59.700
Crap!

00:16:01.340 --> 00:16:04.810
<i>Doesn't look like he
stands a chance at all...</i>

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:06.240
<i>Moron...</i>

00:16:10.550 --> 00:16:11.920
<i>Left! Left!</i>

00:16:13.350 --> 00:16:14.790
<i>Right! Right!</i>

00:16:24.430 --> 00:16:25.290
Yikes!

00:16:26.300 --> 00:16:29.000
<i>Damn punk is scurrying all over the place!</i>

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:31.970
<i>- Hey, doesn't it seem strange?
- Strange how?</i>

00:16:31.970 --> 00:16:34.960
<i>He's choosing paths the Kong
can pass through...</i>

00:16:36.530 --> 00:16:38.250
<i>Is he leading us on?</i>

00:16:38.650 --> 00:16:41.250
<i>What the hell's he up to?!</i>

00:16:41.250 --> 00:16:43.180
<i>He's totally flipped out</i>

00:16:43.180 --> 00:16:44.480
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:47.700
<i>We could make mincemeat outta
him if he didn't have the key!</i>

00:16:50.020 --> 00:16:53.690
<i>He's shootin' pellets again!
Is he mocking us?!</i>

00:17:04.400 --> 00:17:06.840
<i>Run him over!</i>

00:17:06.840 --> 00:17:08.580
<i>Eh? But the key!</i>

00:17:08.580 --> 00:17:10.980
<i>It's better than blasting it to bits!</i>

00:17:10.980 --> 00:17:13.070
<i>And if it breaks, it's still a draw!</i>

00:17:13.070 --> 00:17:14.000
<i>Go!</i>

00:17:14.000 --> 00:17:15.980
<i>He's red!</i>

00:17:22.260 --> 00:17:24.380
<i>- What's this?!
- A cliff!</i>

00:17:27.090 --> 00:17:28.230
Idiots!

00:17:31.500 --> 00:17:32.370
<i>Ow!</i>

00:17:32.370 --> 00:17:33.260
<i>Don't move!</i>

00:17:37.040 --> 00:17:42.210
<i>Alright, Kanta! Are you insane,
takin' on the Kong like that?!</i>

00:17:42.510 --> 00:17:44.220
<i>Give me back my key!</i>

00:17:44.710 --> 00:17:46.460
<i>M-make with the key!</i>

00:17:46.980 --> 00:17:48.660
<i>No funny moves!</i>

00:17:48.660 --> 00:17:50.210
Bastards...

00:17:57.220 --> 00:18:01.730
Stay outta this! I'm enjoying myself!

00:18:01.730 --> 00:18:05.800
If the Kong gets the best
of me, this key'll go boom!

00:18:06.440 --> 00:18:07.600
<i>Sunabouzu?</i>

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:13.800
Wouldn't you prefer that
over being tortured to death, too?!

00:18:14.410 --> 00:18:15.850
Or...

00:18:16.080 --> 00:18:18.510
...should I pull the pin right here?

00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:28.990
<i>Hey, he left.</i>

00:18:28.990 --> 00:18:33.560
<i>- This is bad. He'll totally do it.
- Yeah! Definitely.</i>

00:18:33.560 --> 00:18:39.360
<i>Kanta's thrown his share of grenades
at us, so we know all too well...</i>

00:18:40.500 --> 00:18:43.200
<i>Talk about close childhood friends...</i>

00:18:43.200 --> 00:18:45.830
<i>Our only real option is to kill him...</i>

00:18:46.470 --> 00:18:49.710
<i>- Oh, hello.</i>

00:18:46.470 --> 00:18:49.710
- Hello, Hiro-kun.

00:18:49.710 --> 00:18:50.640
Want some help?

00:18:50.640 --> 00:18:53.320
<i>No thanks. I'm gonna kill
the Sunabouzu myself.</i>

00:18:53.320 --> 00:18:54.050
And then?

00:18:54.050 --> 00:18:58.550
<i>And then take the key
to Koji-san, of course-</i>

00:18:58.550 --> 00:19:01.390
So you're a spy for the eldest son?

00:19:01.390 --> 00:19:03.030
<i>Yeah, you could say that</i>

00:19:03.030 --> 00:19:05.390
Would this be the key?

00:19:05.390 --> 00:19:06.760
<i>Yeah, that's it!</i>

00:19:10.930 --> 00:19:13.360
<i>Where are you, Sunabouzu?!</i>

00:19:14.330 --> 00:19:16.180
<i>There he is!</i>

00:19:16.540 --> 00:19:20.170
<i>After him! He must be run over!</i>

00:19:20.610 --> 00:19:23.800
<i>Don't think you can escape, Sunabouzu!</i>

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:27.180
<i>Flatten him!</i>

00:19:31.820 --> 00:19:32.810
<i>Hiro-kun?</i>

00:19:35.230 --> 00:19:39.390
<i>So, where did he go?</i>

00:19:39.390 --> 00:19:40.150
<i>What?</i>

00:19:45.930 --> 00:19:52.470
<i>You're the first one to ever make
such a complete fool out of me...</i>

00:19:52.470 --> 00:19:54.430
<i>...Sunabouzu!</i>

00:19:57.310 --> 00:19:58.040
<i>Eh?!</i>

00:19:58.040 --> 00:19:58.910
<i>What is it?!</i>

00:20:00.150 --> 00:20:02.020
<i>It's Sunabouzu!</i>

00:20:02.020 --> 00:20:04.820
<i>Oh, crap! He really is gonna die fighting!</i>

00:20:04.820 --> 00:20:07.560
<i>Oh no! My key!</i>

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:11.970
<i>- It's no use! It's too late!
- But! But! But!</i>

00:20:12.260 --> 00:20:14.230
My final shot...

00:20:14.230 --> 00:20:17.200
My magazine's screwed up,
so there's no 2nd shot.

00:20:17.200 --> 00:20:19.100
You know, Kong-san.

00:20:19.100 --> 00:20:23.570
You really are the biggest and
mightiest in the Great Kanto Desert.

00:20:23.570 --> 00:20:27.270
I doubt there's anything
bigger in this desert!

00:20:27.970 --> 00:20:28.470
<i>What?!</i>

00:20:30.210 --> 00:20:31.120
So...

00:20:41.650 --> 00:20:45.890
So I doubt you've ever been
attacked from directly above.

00:20:47.490 --> 00:20:50.460
<i>Such recklessness!</i>

00:20:50.460 --> 00:20:55.440
<i>Is this the real you, Sunabouzu,
Ghost of the Desert?!</i>

00:20:55.640 --> 00:20:58.570
<i>The mighty Kong!</i>

00:20:58.570 --> 00:21:00.140
<i>My key!</i>

00:21:00.140 --> 00:21:03.170
<i>Kanta was a dimwit after all...</i>

00:21:04.180 --> 00:21:05.310
<i>Huh?</i>

00:21:05.310 --> 00:21:09.380
<i>- Whoa, he's alive!
- Does that mean my key is too?!</i>

00:21:09.380 --> 00:21:15.030
It's finally your guys' turn,
Machine Gun Brothers!

00:21:16.490 --> 00:21:19.340
<i>- Eat this!
- Come on out!</i>

00:21:22.530 --> 00:21:24.670
<i>Everyone evacuate!</i>

00:21:24.730 --> 00:21:27.260
<i>- Yeah, right!
- We'd be Swiss cheese out there!</i>

00:21:27.260 --> 00:21:28.960
<i>But if this keeps up!</i>

00:21:32.040 --> 00:21:36.740
The Kong was too big to chase
a rat into a narrow place,

00:21:36.740 --> 00:21:39.050
and its armaments too powerful.

00:21:39.050 --> 00:21:44.270
The only place it can reign
supreme is in the wide-ass desert.

00:21:44.750 --> 00:21:46.950
That'll teach ya to be arrogant...

00:21:48.620 --> 00:21:55.030
<i>And so the five somehow managed
to acquire a great sum of money.</i>

00:21:55.030 --> 00:21:57.060
<i>The moral of the day:</i>

00:21:57.060 --> 00:22:00.770
<i>Not all girls with huge
knockers are airheads.</i>

00:22:00.770 --> 00:22:04.730
<i>Today was another hot day
in the Great Kanto Desert...</i>

00:22:05.540 --> 00:22:10.530
<i>Wow! You're the first person
to ever beat the Kong...</i>

00:22:11.080 --> 00:22:14.050
<i>...Ghost of the Desert, Sunabouzu!</i>

00:22:16.150 --> 00:22:18.420
I guess!

00:22:18.420 --> 00:22:19.650
Now let me rub your breasts!

00:22:21.920 --> 00:22:24.550
<i>Won't he just die already?</i>

00:23:56.080 --> 00:23:58.080
<i>Yo! Ghost of the Desert, Sunabouzu here!</i>

00:23:58.080 --> 00:24:01.650
<i>That boob lady sure was smart!
Who'll the next one be?!</i>

00:24:01.650 --> 00:24:03.050
<i>- Fuyuo will!
- Akio will!</i>

00:24:03.050 --> 00:24:06.020
<i>- Minami Haruo will! (famous singer)
- Like hell, he will!</i>

00:24:06.020 --> 00:24:08.290
<i>On the next Sunabouzu -
Sniping and Footsteps</i>

00:24:08.290 --> 00:24:10.260
<i>Miss it and it's electric massage time!</i>
